- `InstantiationService`, which imports `_util`, reads those recorded dependencies, sorts them by constructor index, and resolves each identifier into an injected service. A recording change therefore directly changes constructor injection. [instantiationService.ts:12]({REPO_ROOT}/target/benchmarks/agent-navigation/final-2d6319d/r03-huge-vscode-plain/huge-vscode/src/vs/platform/instantiation/common/instantiationService.ts:12) [instantiationService.ts:137]({REPO_ROOT}/target/benchmarks/agent-navigation/final-2d6319d/r03-huge-vscode-plain/huge-vscode/src/vs/platform/instantiation/common/instantiationService.ts:137)
